<section id="main-functions" class="level3">
<h3 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="main-functions">Main Functions</h3>
<p><strong>setup()</strong> - Sets pin modes</p>
<p><strong>loop()</strong> - Does four main things:</p>
<ol type="1">
<li><p><strong>Distance Control Reading</strong></p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb2" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode cpp code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode cpp"><span id="cb2-1"><span class="dt" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
