<item>
  <title>Turbocharger Vane Wear Analysis Using Statistical Image Processing</title>
  <link>https://rsangole.netlify.app/mechatronics/vane_wear/doc.html</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 
<script src="https://ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/jquery/2.0.3/jquery.min.js"></script>

